Z||000000||Alex4mula||03-01-2001||09:24 AM||||I visit often a Corvette forum with this same format. Every time I go there I appreciate more this forum. There's so many people in there that if you post a question and wait too long (1-2hrs?) when you return back it is in the 2nd or 3rd page (off screen) & you spent a lot of time searching for an answer like "Mmm, Aahh, if it's in warranty you should take it to the dealer". Duhh! Of course I know that. Not too much knowledge except for some common high $$ mods and then most of the time is "yeah my mechanic installed it & it added 15HP" (all cars are dynoed there). Then you have these page long signatures with C5 photos & animations and 10 lines bragging about their $modifications. The same guy post three times & you are screwed dowloading that page. Please let us not degrade into that. I had chance to decide between selling my C5 or my Formula. Guess which one will be sold? Sorry if my venting bothered some of you.||||reg||1
